Multiple actions can be provided at once. Example:
fill(\PYGZsq{}a12\PYGZsq{}, \PYGZsq{}example with \PYGZdq{}quotes\PYGZdq{}\PYGZsq{})
click(\PYGZsq{}51\PYGZsq{})
click(\PYGZsq{}48\PYGZsq{}, button=\PYGZsq{}middle\PYGZsq{}, modifiers=[\PYGZsq{}Shift\PYGZsq{}])
Multiple actions are meant to be executed sequentially without any feedback from the page.
Don\PYGZsq{}t execute multiple actions at once if you need feedback from the page.

